Machine-drafted move entries land here. Nothing in this directory is published.

The content loader cannot see it: getSlugs filters readdirSync on ".mdx", and a
directory name never matches. Reaching the site takes a deliberate `git mv` up
one level plus setting `verified: true` once the facts are checked.

This file exists so the directory does. Git doesn't track empty directories,
and the daily workflow's `git add content/moves/_drafts/` fails with a pathspec
error when the path is missing — which is exactly what happened on the first
two scheduled runs.

`npm run drafts` lists what's waiting.
